e bird pin for  each of them they're all unique but fit  together like pieces of a puzzle or get  matching posters to let your friends  know you're thinking of them or just  browse all the sciency things we made  for you if you like videos like this  getting something from our shop is the  best way to support us thank you for  watching  Queen  [Music]
 

